  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOJANG: Block by Block e-learning module</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN-Habitat and Msft have decided to collaborate on the &#x201c;Block by Block&#x201d; project, an innovative partnership project through which Minecraft is used as a community participation tool in the urban design workshops that are conducted as part of the sustainable urban development projects. 
Microsoft has been providing UN-Habitat with a yearly contribution of US$ 100,000 (United States Dollars One Hundred Thousand) to support Block by Block funded projects. In 2022, Microsoft renewed its commitment with UN-Habitat for one additional year for US$ 100,000  to support several learning and educational activities.</narrative>
  </description>
